A||N||17||FieroMaster88||I need help BAD!!! (Clutch Problem Again)||||8||
Z||000000||FieroMaster88||11-30-2001||10:41 PM||||Well, I replaced everything on my car.  The master cylinder, slave cylinder, clutch, installed a steel clutch petal and the line is new.  It worked great for 2 weeks.  All of a sudden wednesday the clutch stopped disengaugeing.  When I start the car (in nutral) and try to put it into gear it wont work.  I just spent 2 hours bleeding and bleeding it out, absolutely NO air!  <P>I am thinking aobut taking it to a Mechenic...which sounds bad to anyone that knows me!  Please give me some good suggestions!!!  <P>PS.  Every part is a Factory GM part.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jamessig.jpg">                   <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>Not your ordinary 88 coupe!||||reg||8
Z||000001||FieroMaster88||12-01-2001||01:00 PM||||Bump!   Anyone have an Idea?||||reg||9
Z||000002||StuGood||12-01-2001||01:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroMaster88:<BR><B>I just spent 2 hours bleeding and bleeding it out, absolutely NO air...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE>He's a real NO air man...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Okay, sorry - bad time for jokes.  Sounds like it's back-to-the-basics time.  What year/ what engine/ what trans. (I'm assuming 1988 model based on the name you use - I also assume it's 4-cyl and Isuzu, since they seem the most problematic)?<P>Next step is to get help and measure the amount the slave cylinder moves, when the pedal is depressed...     <P>||||reg||5
Z||000003||MrPBody||12-01-2001||02:28 PM||||Bummer!<P>How much slave cylinder travel do you have?  (Does the release arm move enough?)<P><I>Edit -- I didn't refresh before posting.  Ditto StuGood.</I><BR><p>[This message has been edited by MrPBody (edited 12-01-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||drednot||12-01-2001||05:46 PM||||You have a bent clutch release fork.  Trash that car, it's finished.||||reg||1
